The '''Continuum''' is a [[Location]] in the [[Rift Dimension]] found at the entrance of {{Zone|The Mountaintop}}.

== Purpose ==
The '''Continuum''' serves as the home of {{NPCSprite|Oruo The Almighty}}, who allows players to fight {{NPCSprite|Sun Gecko}} and access the [[Essence Shops|Sun Gecko Essence Shop]].

